@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-45 - Export Inventory Report

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Inventory UI" as FE
control "InventoryController" as API
control "InventoryService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoesDetail, stockMovements" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-45
FE -> API: Inventory export endpoint recommended
API -> Service: Execute Export Inventory Report
Service -> DB: Read/write shoesDetail, stockMovements
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: File báo cáo được tải xuống

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang xem inventory
Post: File báo cáo được tải xuống
Main flow:
1. Admin bấm Export
2. System generate CSV/Excel từ dữ liệu inventory
3. System trả về file download
end note
@enduml
